        'unit-converter' => [
            'manually_edited' => true,
            'introduction' => 'Unit Converter changes a value between selected length, weight, temperature and volume units. It supports common metric conversions and clearly labelled US customary conversions such as miles, pounds, US gallons and US fluid ounces. This distinction matters because an imperial gallon or fluid ounce is not the same size as its US counterpart. Choose one direction, enter the source value and read the result with its destination symbol. Temperature uses an offset as well as a scale, while ordinary length, weight and volume conversions multiply by a fixed factor. The tool keeps more precision during calculation and displays up to six decimal places without unnecessary trailing zeros. Use it for study, travel, packaging, recipes and quick specification checks, but confirm the required unit system and rounding rule before using the result in regulated, scientific or safety-critical work.',
            'steps' => [
                ['title' => 'Identify the source unit', 'description' => 'Read the original measurement and confirm whether it uses metric or a labelled US customary unit.'],
